{"seq":1,"slug":"task-orchestration","title":"任务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/task-orchestration","wordCount":906,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务编排\">任务编排</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>任务编排</strong>（Task Orchestration）解决的是 Monorepo 中&quot;一个命令涉及多个包、包间又有依赖&quot;的问题。它的核心是一个算法加三层工具能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拓扑排序</td>\n<td>将依赖 DAG 转为线性/分批执行序列</td>\n<td>编排引擎的调度内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>^build</code> 语义</td>\n<td>&quot;先构建当前包的所有上游依赖包&quot;</td>\n<td><code>turbo.json</code> / <code>nx.json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无依赖任务</td>\n<td><code>dependsOn: []</code>，可与首批次同时启动</td>\n<td>最大化并行度的关键</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>编排的价值在于<strong>把依赖顺序的正确性从人工转移到工具</strong>：没有它，开发者只能手写 shell 脚本维持构建顺序，规模一增长便不可维护。Turborepo、Nx、Lerna 三者都建立在拓扑排序之上，差异在缓存能力、代码生成与生态，而非调度算法本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要任务编排\">为什么需要任务编排</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中，一个简单的 <code>build</code> 命令涉及多个包，而这些包之间存在依赖关系。如果 <code>@myorg/ui</code> 依赖 <code>@myorg/utils</code>，那么 <code>utils</code> 必须先于 <code>ui</code> 构建。<strong>任务编排</strong>（Task Orchestration）就是自动理解这些依赖关系，按正确顺序执行任务，同时最大化并行度的能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    TYPES[&quot;@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;build ①&quot;]&#10;    CONFIG[&quot;@myorg/config&lt;br/&gt;build ①&quot;]&#10;    UTILS[&quot;@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;build ②&quot;]&#10;    UI[&quot;@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;build ③&quot;]&#10;    WEB[&quot;@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;build ④&quot;]&#10;&#10;    UTILS --&gt; TYPES&#10;    UI --&gt; UTILS&#10;    UI --&gt; CONFIG&#10;    WEB --&gt; UI\">graph BT\n    TYPES[\"@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;build ①\"]\n    CONFIG[\"@myorg/config&lt;br/&gt;build ①\"]\n    UTILS[\"@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;build ②\"]\n    UI[\"@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;build ③\"]\n    WEB[\"@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;build ④\"]\n\n    UTILS --&gt; TYPES\n    UI --&gt; UTILS\n    UI --&gt; CONFIG\n    WEB --&gt; UI</pre><p>没有任务编排工具时，开发者要么手动按顺序运行构建脚本，要么写复杂的 shell 脚本来处理依赖顺序。这在包数量增长后迅速变得不可维护。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo\">Turborepo</h2><p><strong>Turborepo</strong> 是 Vercel 推出的高性能 Monorepo 构建系统，以简洁的配置和极致的缓存能力著称。它通过 <code>turbo.json</code> 定义任务的依赖关系和缓存策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;.next/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tests/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".next/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tests/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"依赖语义\">依赖语义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>^build</code></td>\n<td>先构建所有上游依赖包</td>\n<td><code>ui</code> 依赖 <code>utils</code>，先构建 <code>utils</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>build</code></td>\n<td>同一个包内先执行 build</td>\n<td><code>test</code> 依赖同包的 <code>build</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[]</code></td>\n<td>无依赖，可立即并行执行</td>\n<td><code>lint</code> 不依赖任何任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 常用 Turborepo 命令&#10;// turbo run build                    构建所有包&#10;// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui 只构建指定包&#10;// turbo run build --filter=./apps/*  只构建 apps 下的包&#10;// turbo run dev --parallel           并行启动所有 dev server&#10;// turbo run build --dry-run          预览执行计划&#10;// turbo run build --graph            生成依赖图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 常用 Turborepo 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build                    构建所有包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui 只构建指定包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=./apps/*  只构建 apps 下的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run dev --parallel           并行启动所有 dev server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --dry-run          预览执行计划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --graph            生成依赖图</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"nx\">Nx</h2><p><strong>Nx</strong> 是由 Nrwl 开发的功能丰富的 Monorepo 工具集，不仅提供任务编排，还内置了代码生成器、依赖图可视化和插件体系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;targetDefaults&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;{projectRoot}/dist&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;namedInputs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;default&quot;: [&quot;{projectRoot}/**/*&quot;],&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/tests/**/*&quot;, &quot;!{projectRoot}/**/*.spec.ts&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targetDefaults\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{projectRoot}/dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"namedInputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{projectRoot}/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!{projectRoot}/tests/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!{projectRoot}/**/*.spec.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Nx 项目级配置 - project.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;targets&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;executor&quot;: &quot;@nx/next:build&quot;,&#10;      &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;outputPath&quot;: &quot;dist/apps/web&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;serve&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;executor&quot;: &quot;@nx/next:server&quot;,&#10;      &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;port&quot;: 3000&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Nx 项目级配置 - project.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"executor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@nx/next:build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"outputPath\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/apps/web\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"serve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"executor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@nx/next:server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-的差异化特性\">Nx 的差异化特性</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Nx 生态&quot;&#10;        GRAPH[&quot;依赖图可视化&lt;br/&gt;nx graph&quot;]&#10;        GEN[&quot;代码生成器&lt;br/&gt;nx generate&quot;]&#10;        PLUGIN[&quot;插件体系&lt;br/&gt;@nx/react, @nx/node&quot;]&#10;        CLOUD[&quot;Nx Cloud&lt;br/&gt;远程缓存 + 分布式执行&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Nx 生态\"\n        GRAPH[\"依赖图可视化&lt;br/&gt;nx graph\"]\n        GEN[\"代码生成器&lt;br/&gt;nx generate\"]\n        PLUGIN[\"插件体系&lt;br/&gt;@nx/react, @nx/node\"]\n        CLOUD[\"Nx Cloud&lt;br/&gt;远程缓存 + 分布式执行\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lerna\">Lerna</h2><p><strong>Lerna</strong> 是最早的 Monorepo 管理工具之一，现在由 Nx 团队维护，底层使用 Nx 的任务调度能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;node_modules/lerna/schemas/lerna-schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;independent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;npmClient&quot;: &quot;pnpm&quot;,&#10;  &quot;useWorkspaces&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;command&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;conventionalCommits&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;publish&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;registry&quot;: &quot;https://registry.npmjs.org&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node_modules/lerna/schemas/lerna-schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"independent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"npmClient\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"useWorkspaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"conventionalCommits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"publish\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"registry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://registry.npmjs.org\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果你的核心需求是多包版本管理和发布，Lerna + Changesets 的组合仍然是成熟的方案。如果更侧重构建性能和缓存，Turborepo 或 Nx 是更好的选择。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工具对比\">工具对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Turborepo</th>\n<th>Nx</th>\n<th>Lerna</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心定位</td>\n<td>构建系统</td>\n<td>全功能工具集</td>\n<td>版本管理 + 发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存能力</td>\n<td>本地 + 远程</td>\n<td>本地 + Nx Cloud</td>\n<td>依赖 Nx</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖图可视化</td>\n<td>CLI + <code>--graph</code></td>\n<td>内置 Web UI</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件生态</td>\n<td>无（约定优于配置）</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n<td>较陡</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>小到大</td>\n<td>中到大</td>\n<td>小到中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑排序与任务调度\">拓扑排序与任务调度</h2><p>任务编排的核心算法是<strong>拓扑排序</strong>（Topological Sort）。它将包的依赖 DAG 转化为线性执行序列，确保每个包在其依赖包之后执行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 拓扑排序过程&#10;        direction LR&#10;        S1[&quot;找出入度为 0 的节点&lt;br/&gt;(types, config)&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;移除已处理节点&lt;br/&gt;更新入度&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;重复直到所有节点&lt;br/&gt;处理完毕&quot;]&#10;        S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 执行顺序&#10;        direction LR&#10;        B1[&quot;批次 1: types, config&lt;br/&gt;(并行)&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;批次 2: utils&lt;br/&gt;(等待 types)&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;批次 3: ui&lt;br/&gt;(等待 utils, config)&quot;]&#10;        B4[&quot;批次 4: web, admin&lt;br/&gt;(并行)&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B2 --&gt; B3 --&gt; B4&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 拓扑排序过程\n        direction LR\n        S1[\"找出入度为 0 的节点&lt;br/&gt;(types, config)\"]\n        S2[\"移除已处理节点&lt;br/&gt;更新入度\"]\n        S3[\"重复直到所有节点&lt;br/&gt;处理完毕\"]\n        S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3\n    end\n    subgraph 执行顺序\n        direction LR\n        B1[\"批次 1: types, config&lt;br/&gt;(并行)\"]\n        B2[\"批次 2: utils&lt;br/&gt;(等待 types)\"]\n        B3[\"批次 3: ui&lt;br/&gt;(等待 utils, config)\"]\n        B4[\"批次 4: web, admin&lt;br/&gt;(并行)\"]\n        B1 --&gt; B2 --&gt; B3 --&gt; B4\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TaskNode {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  dependencies: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function topologicalSort(nodes: TaskNode[]): string[][] {&#10;  const inDegree = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  const graph = new Map&lt;string, string[]&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const node of nodes) {&#10;    inDegree.set(node.name, node.dependencies.length);&#10;    for (const dep of node.dependencies) {&#10;      const existing = graph.get(dep) ?? [];&#10;      existing.push(node.name);&#10;      graph.set(dep, existing);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const batches: string[][] = [];&#10;  const queue = [...inDegree.entries()].filter(([, degree]) =&gt; degree === 0).map(([name]) =&gt; name);&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    batches.push([...queue]);&#10;    const nextQueue: string[] = [];&#10;    for (const name of queue) {&#10;      for (const dependent of graph.get(name) ?? []) {&#10;        const newDegree = (inDegree.get(dependent) ?? 0) - 1;&#10;        inDegree.set(dependent, newDegree);&#10;        if (newDegree === 0) nextQueue.push(dependent);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    queue.length = 0;&#10;    queue.push(...nextQueue);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return batches;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">